--- A moment moved by an int read from text: `int[…]` answers a whole
--- number of any size, and a moment moved by one is moved by its seconds
--- (compiled, `t + n` had not built — E0277, a growing int beside a moment).
n = int['3600']
t = moment['2026-11-04T10:00:00Z']
log[t + n]
log[t - n]
log[n + t]
